# Repositories

- `@LazySingleton(as: IFooRepository)`. Inject the Graph client and AutoMappr mapper. Do not call GraphQL from use cases or blocs.
- Client returns `TaskEither<BaseGraphError, Model>`. Map to entity with **`GraphModelMapper` static methods** in `infrastructure/shared/map_graph_model.dart`. Do not add local `_mapCreate` / `_tryMap`.
- Keep **`mapCreate` / `mapGet` / `mapListItem` / `mapUpdate` as separate functions**. Do not collapse them into one generic `map`. Pass both type args: GraphQL model (`Source`) then entity (`Target`).
- Lists: `TaskEither.traverseList` + `mapListItem`. Delete has no entity map — `mapLeft` only.
- Then `mapLeft` Graph errors (`toCartFailure()` / `toFailure()`).

```dart
return _client.createCart().flatMap(
  (model) => GraphModelMapper.mapCreate<Mutation$CreateCart$createCart, CartEntity>(
    model,
    mapper: _mapper,
    parseErrorType: GraphQlErrorType.cartParseError,
  ),
).mapLeft((error) => error.toCartFailure());
```
